Keep a shared trail as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared bestpath as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared final as empty text.
Keep a shared have as 0.
Keep a shared smaller as 0.

To drain.
The count is the number of items in bestpath.
Repeat while count is more than 0.
remove the last item from bestpath.
Subtract 1 from count.

To record.
For each piece in trail, The saved is a copy of piece, Place saved into bestpath.

To store.
Drain.
Record.

To compare.
Set smaller to 0.
The spot is the last position of trail.
The other is the last position of bestpath.
Repeat while spot is at least 0 and other is at least 0.
The left is item spot of trail.
The right is item other of bestpath.
If left comes before right, set smaller to 1, return.
If right comes before left, return.
Subtract 1 from spot.
Subtract 1 from other.

To visit.
If have is 0, store, set have to 1, return.
Compare.
If smaller is 1, store.

To report.
The spot is the last position of bestpath.
Repeat while spot is at least 0.
Place item spot of bestpath into final.
Subtract 1 from spot.

To look from node (a whole number).
If node is less than 0, return.
The piece is the slice of alphabet from item node of labels to item node of labels plus 1.
The held is a copy of piece.
Place held into trail.
If item node of lefts is less than 0 and item node of rights is less than 0, visit.
Look from item node of lefts.
Look from item node of rights.
Remove the last item from trail.

Look from 0.
Report.
Show final.
